from name ../../module/verifier_circle.pya to name verifier circle be import do

exists su name author prompter ob text "Draft a concise answer for TASK. If review feedback is present, apply it exactly and fix factual issues." be text ya
exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name author prompter ya
exists su name verifier prompter ob text "Verify factual grounding and fit. Return PASS or FAIL." be text ya
exists su name verifier be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" fromtext name verifier prompter ya

exists su name input ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya

ob name text input for name mind author by name mind verifier atleast num 0.8 atmost num 3 to name text output be verifier circle verifier trying do
ob name output be write do
